IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q08-DAILY-TRANSFER.
*> Transfer with daily limit (500). Rejected runs keep balances.
*> Tests: normal transfer, exact limit, over limit, low balance.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-SRC-BAL          PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-DST-BAL          PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-TXN-AMT          PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-DAILY-USED       PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-DAILY-LIMIT      PIC 9(9) VALUE 500.
01  WS-NEW-DAILY        PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-SRC-BAL
    ACCEPT WS-DST-BAL
    ACCEPT WS-TXN-AMT
    ACCEPT WS-DAILY-USED

    COMPUTE WS-NEW-DAILY = WS-DAILY-USED + WS-TXN-AMT

    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-TXN-AMT <= 0
            DISPLAY "REJECTED: INVALID AMOUNT"
        WHEN WS-TXN-AMT > WS-SRC-BAL
            DISPLAY "REJECTED: INSUFFICIENT FUNDS"
        WHEN WS-NEW-DAILY > WS-DAILY-LIMIT
            DISPLAY "REJECTED: DAILY LIMIT EXCEEDED"
        WHEN OTHER
            SUBTRACT WS-TXN-AMT FROM WS-SRC-BAL
            ADD WS-TXN-AMT TO WS-DST-BAL
            DISPLAY "SUCCESS"
    END-EVALUATE

    DISPLAY "SOURCE: " WS-SRC-BAL
    DISPLAY "DEST:   " WS-DST-BAL
    STOP RUN.
